agenic? Quick memory: 1,2-dichloroethane is a possible mutagen, but I think it\'s not strongly mutagenic. However, I should check: The Ames test for 1,2-dichloroethane shows negative results at certain concentrations. According to some data, 1,2-dichloroethane is negative in the Ames test (no mutagenicity). So likely not mutagenic.\\n\\nThus choose (A). I\'ll answer accordingly.assistantfinalAnswer: (A)'
